      "content": "but i cant climb a mountain when i'm literally buried under it. it's not just a bad week, it's everything. it's the letters in the mail, the phone calls, the way my chest feels tight every single morning. it feels like there's just no exit. like the math just doesn't work and no amount of 'small steps' is ever gonna change the total. it's just a dead end.",
